        "Order Mode - MTS (nb)",
        "Order Mode - MTO (nb)",
        "Delayed Orders (nb)",
        "Taux de conformité qualité (%)",
        "Scrap Rate (%)",
        "Rework Rate (%)",
        "Takt Time (s)",
        "Production Throughput (ent/h)",
