    "Temps de simulation (secondes)",
    "Niveau d'agregation (MICRO_ACTIVITE/SCOR_N3/GLOBAL)",
    "Source de l'agregation (agent/poste)",
    "Identifiant du poste",
    "Code SCOR (niveau 3)",
